EXT. SECTOR 4 - ALLEYWAY - NIGHT

Rain lashes against rusted steel fire escapes. Neon reflections shimmer in dirty puddles.

KADE MERCER (40s), trenchcoat soaked, scans the darkness. His left eye glows faint cobalt blue.

KADE
(whispering into comm)
She was here. The trail is still warm.

He steps forward. The glow from a broken holographic billboard flickers.

CUT TO:

INT. UNDERGROUND CLUB - CONTINUOUS
